      "greedy_continuation": " filled. Blessed are the merciful: for they shall obtain mercy. Blessed are the pure in heart: for they shall see God. Blessed are the peacemakers: for they shall be called the children of God. Blessed are they which are persecuted for righteousness' sake",
      "samples": [
        " filled. Blessed are the merciful: for they shall obtain mercy. Blessed are the pure in heart: for they shall see God. Blessed are the peacemakers: for they shall be called the children of God.\n\nBlessed are they which are persecuted for",
        " filled. Blessed are the merciful: for they shall obtain mercy. Blessed are the pure in heart: for they shall see God. Blessed are the peacemakers: for they shall be called the children of God. Blessed are they which are persecuted for righteousness' sake",
        " filled.\n\nThe Pharisees and Sadducees came up to test him, saying, \"Tell us, when shall these things be, and what shall be the sign of thy coming, and of the end of the world?\"\n\nJesus answered and said to them, \""
