      "greedy_continuation": " didn't tell, but he told the truth. He told the truth about the things that happened to him, and he told the truth about the things that happened to the people that he knew. He told the truth about the things that happened to the people that he didn't know. He told the",
      "samples": [
        " didn't tell in that book that he would have told if he had lived to write another.\"\n\n\"You think I'm a liar?\" I asked.\n\n\"Why, no! You never done no harm, Mr. Prince. You must go up-stairs now, and git ready",
        " had there that I couldn't spell. But I knowed what he meant, and I knowed I had heard them all before.\n\n\"You've read that book, and you 'most know who Tom Sawyer is by this time. He was a boy that was raised by Mink and",
        " didn't tell in that book, and that is what we're talking about now. I don't know that I believe that Mr. Mark Twain was a naturalist, but he was a good deal of a naturalist, at least he told the truth. Some of his stories were really true"
      ],
