      ],
      "greedy_continuation": " scrutinized and studied, perhaps almost as narrowly as a man with a microscope might scrutinize the transient creatures that swarm and multiply in a drop of water.\n\nThe world was very much as the world had been; but it was a different world.\n\n#  **II**\n\n",
      "samples": [
        " scrutinized and studied, perhaps even feared, by intelligences greater than man's.\n\nIn such a belief, men and women of goodwill could be expected to act accordingly.\n\nSuch a belief was absurd.\n\nIt had been absurd for thousands of years.\n\nIt was",
        " scrutinized and measured, and their very motives were subject for the scrutiny and for the possible removal of the stones that coated their path.\n\nThe nineteenth century was a creative period; the twenties and thirties were a period of exploration and development. Life was more than ever complex, more than",
        " scrutinised and sized by the intelligences of abysses beyond the reach of mere man; that, under the guise of human relationships, they were poisoning each other's minds and hearts; that the noblest and the best of men were habitually bunglers and charlatans;"
      ],
      "manipulation": {},
      "gold_logprob_per_token": -0.4407196640968323
    },
