      "greedy_continuation": "\n\nBrown Sauce (2 Cups Sauce) Excellent with roast beef. Brown Gravy (2 Cups Sauce) Excellent with roast beef.\n\nBrown Gravy (2 Cups Sauce) Excellent with roast beef. Brown Gravy (2 Cups Sauce) Excellent with roast beef.\n",
      "samples": [
        "\n\nThis is the baby version of the amazing sauce that is the backbone of the Spice Islands Beef Stock Base. The flavor is so good you'll wonder why you saved the baby sauce for last. You can use it on any cut of beef from sirloin to eye of round.",
        " Chicken Stock Base (2 Cups Stock) Great with chicken or turkey. Chicken Stock Base (3 Cups Stock) Great with chicken or turkey. Brown Sauce (1 Cup Wine) Great with beef. Chicken Stock Base (2 Cups Wine) Great with chicken or turkey. Brown Sauce (",
        "\n\nAdd Cinnamon, Sugar, and Salt. Mix with a whisk.\n\nSTORES: Keep in a cool, dry place for up to one year.\n\nSTORAGE: Keep refrigerated for up to one week.\n\n> * * *\n\n###\n"
      ],
      "manipulation": {},
      "gold_logprob_per_token": -2.781212091445923
    },
