      "greedy_continuation": " she, I don't think you'll find my card here. You're new; how interesting. Can you read the letters on that chart? Open your mouth. Breathe. Do you have headaches? No. Ah, yes, you are new. I'm new, said she, I",
      "samples": [
        " she. And are you nervous? Yes. I am nervous. I can tell. I thought I could, said she. You see, I'm new, I haven't got your cards yet. You have one of your own, I hope. No, that's not quite right, said she",
        " she.\n\n\"I'm new,\" she said, \"I'm new,\" said she, \"I'm new.\"\n\nIn the van she got in with an old man whose name was Barry. Barry was supposed to be an old man. He was supposed to be seventy-five years",
        " the lady.\n\nWhen they put their cards in their envelopes, they said, \"Good afternoon, may I write you?\" I can ask for the pleasure of your company to go to the park with me, said one. I will call you this evening, said she smiling.\n\nAt"
