      "greedy_continuation": " beans, and sometimes a slice of bread and butter.\n\nThe average family of four ate about 1,000 calories a day. The average adult male weighed about 150 pounds, and the average adult female weighed about 110 pounds.\n\nThe average family of four ate about 1,000 calories a",
      "samples": [
        " beans, cornbread, or luncheon meat and eggs.\n\nHalf-day rations usually consist of coffee, milk, bread, butter, and meat, and a piece of chocolate. Nuts, raisins, cheese, and other perishable foods are kept in the winter",
        " beans, or bannock (biscuit).\n\n_Cowboy and Eastern Saloon, 1883, oil on canvas, by Reginald Marsh. Bucking cattle is not an uncommon occupation in small western towns from mid-September to the end of December. Large parts of",
        " beans.\n\n#### **Wedding Gifts**\n\nA wedding presents a family with an opportunity to show their love through the giving of gifts. Traditionally, the groom's family deploys the so-called \"wedding chest\" and the bride's family the \"wedding basket.\""
