      "greedy_continuation": " but with days of struggle.\n\nI remember a time when I was a young man, and I was very proud of the fact that I had been able to get a job. I was proud of the fact that I had been able to get a job, and I was proud of the fact",
      "samples": [
        " but with days of difficulty.\n\nTHE ROOTS OF DEPRESSION\n\nA friend of mine who has lived a life of considerable success, who is a good-looking, young, handsome, wealthy, healthy, and seemingly successful man, was suddenly stricken with depression and became suicidal",
        " but with days of struggle, of early and deep anguish and disappointment and hurt of one sort or another. And it is a very important thing to realize, that in that anguish and helplessness and pain of the early years of your life, and the conflicts, griefs, and disappointments which often",
        " but with days of travail and difficulty and struggle. Let's face it, the average American is in a state of misery to the extent that he wouldn't know if he hadn't been in the company of the average Englishman, and you look at life as one big struggle, and you acknowledge that"
      ],
      "manipulation": {},
