      "greedy_continuation": " heart.\n\nThe heart is a muscular organ that pumps blood around the body.\n\nThe heart is a muscular organ that pumps blood around the body.\n\nThe heart is a muscular organ that pumps blood around the body.\n\nThe heart is a muscular organ that pumps blood around the",
      "samples": [
        " heart.\n\nThe most famous man in English history is King Henry VIII.\n\nThe most famous women in English history are Margaret Thatcher, Queen Elizabeth II, Queen Victoria, and Queen Mary.\n\nThe oldest living man in England is 1623-year-old James Watt,",
        " heart.\n\nThe organ of speech is the larynx.\n\nThe color of a tooth is a stain called tartar.\n\nThe heart is a small part of the body in a human being that pumps the blood around the body.\n\nThe organ of speech is the vocal cords",
