      "greedy_continuation": " brain.\n\nThe human body is made up of two main parts: the head and the rest of the body.\n\nThe human body is made up of two main parts: the head and the rest of the body.\n\nThe human body is made up of two main parts: the",
      "samples": [
        " brain.\n\nThe sun is made up of gases.\n\nThe Universe is the greatest and most complex thing that we know.\n\nThe Earth is the only planet that has life.\n\nThe Milky Way is the largest galaxy in the Universe.\n\nThe largest animal in the world",
        " skin.\n\nApart from a small amount of fat, our body is mostly water.\n\nThe heart pumps blood throughout the body.\n\nBlood is pumped through the body by the heart.\n\nMuscles are needed to move almost everything we eat. We actually cannot live without them!",
        " brain, which is made up of about one hundred billion neurons.\n\nScientists have found that the long migrations of birds are controlled by the same genetic changes that control migrations in humans.\n\nBlack holes are huge holes in space that are filled with enough mass to become black holes as"
