      "greedy_continuation": " rainbow.\n\nThe word \"rainbow\" comes from the Old English word \"rainan,\" which means \"rainbow.\"\n\nThe rainbow is a natural phenomenon that occurs when water droplets are suspended in the air.\n\nThe rainbow is a natural phenomenon that occurs when water droplets are suspended",
      "samples": [
        " rainbow. It is created when water molecules are frozen. The molecules are frozen into ice crystals and arrange themselves in a specific way based on their chemical structure. When raindrops hit the frozen crystals, the ice crystals break up into tiny droplets and fall to the ground. The droplets are always tiny,",
        " \"rainbow.\"\n\nElectricity is a very useful force that can make things happen and can be helpful.\n\nIn a game called \"Scooby Doo,\" Spooky and the others call out for help when they run out of dynamite.\n\nIn the movie",
        " rainbow.\n\nAn extremely rare condition is called \"Starfish Brain,\" which refers to the condition where the entire head is paralyzed.\n\nThe sky above the North Pole is the most cloudless place in the world.\n\nThe name of the second planet in our solar system is \""
      ],
      "manipulation": {
        "l1_expected_in_output": true
      },
