      "greedy_continuation": " Paris, France.\n\nThe Eiffel Tower is the tallest structure in the world.\n\nThe Eiffel Tower is the tallest structure in Paris.\n\nThe Eiffel Tower is the tallest structure in France.\n\nThe Eiffel Tower is the tall",
      "samples": [
        " Paris, at the top of the western half of the historic island of Ile de la Cité. It is an iconic landmark of France and a symbol of France's metropolis.\n\nThe Eiffel Tower, also known as the Tour Eiffel, is a 420-metre",
