      "greedy_continuation": " eggs.\n\nThe main ingredient of a cake is flour.\n\nThe main ingredient of a pie is fruit.\n\nThe main ingredient of a salad is lettuce.\n\nThe main ingredient of a stew is meat.\n\nThe main ingredient of a soup is water.\n\nThe",
      "samples": [
        " egg whites.\n\nThe main ingredients of an omelette are eggs, milk, and salt.\n\nThe main ingredients of a French omelette are eggs, butter, and cheese.\n\nThe main ingredients of a Swiss omelette are eggs, butter, cheese, and milk",
        " eggs. In this case, the eggs were a part of the omelette. The egg white, egg yolk, or yolks alone were all considered to be the main ingredient.\n\nThe main ingredient of a cake is flour.\n\nThe main ingredient of a quiche is",
        " eggs. In Switzerland you can find omelettes made with different fillings. You can make omelettes with chicken, pork, beef or veal. In this case it doesn't make too much of a difference because the ingredients are so well cooked that there is no risk of poison"
      ],
