      "greedy_continuation": " Mercury.\n\nThe Sun is the only star in the sky that is visible to the naked eye.\n\nThe Sun is the only star in the sky that is visible to the naked eye.\n\nThe Sun is the only star in the sky that is visible to the naked eye.\n",
